Register

curl -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"alice","email":"a@ex.com","password":"Secret123"}' \
  http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register


Login → receive token

curl -X POST -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"alice","password":"Secret123"}' \
  http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login


Response:

{"token":"eyJhbGciOiJI..."}


Create task

curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGci..." -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"title":"Pay rent","description":"Pay by 5th","dueDate":"2025-11-05","status":"PENDING"}' \
  http://localhost:8080/api/tasks


Get tasks

curl -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGci..." http://localhost:8080/api/tasks